"Seaded, mis kehtivad kogu saidil nii seadusjärgse garantii teatise kui ka "
"GARAN-märgise puhul."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:203
msgid ""
"Everything related to the harmonised EU legal-guarantee notice: where and "
"how it appears."
msgstr ""
"Kõik, mis puudutab ühtlustatud ELi seadusjärgse garantii teatist: kus ja "
"kuidas see kuvatakse."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:207
msgid ""
"Everything related to the GARAN commercial durability label: where and how "
"it appears. Set the manufacturer guarantee per product under Product data → "
"EU Guarantee."
msgstr ""
"Kõik, mis puudutab GARAN-i kommertsvastupidavuse märgist: kus ja kuidas see "
"kuvatakse. Määra tootja garantii toote kohta jaotises Toote andmed → EU "
"Guarantee."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:208
msgid ""
"Edit a WooCommerce product and open the \"EU Guarantee\" tab in the product "
"data box. Fill Guarantee duration, brand and model there and the label "
"appears on that product."
msgstr ""
"Ava WooCommerce'i toode ja vali toote andmete plokis vahekaart „EU "
"Guarantee”. Täida seal garantii kestus, kaubamärk ja mudel, siis ilmub "
"märgis sellele tootele."

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:212
msgid ""
"Housekeeping: plugin credit and what happens to your settings on removal."
msgstr ""
"Korrashoid: lisandmooduli tunnustus ja mis juhtub sinu seadetega selle "
"eemaldamisel."

